{"id":"2da3d3afc8d114e5","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-cotreecliques.md","title":"Maximal-clique recursion in a cotree","display":"thm-cotreecliques — Maximal-clique recursion in a cotree","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-cotreecliques","aliases":["27-thm-cotreecliques"],"display":"thm-cotreecliques — Maximal-clique recursion in a cotree","depends_on":["[[27-df-cotree]]","[[27-df-graphops]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§10.5 Lemma 10.2","source_printed_pages":"468","source_pdf_pages":"492","verification_status":"source-statement-and-recursive-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-cotreecliques"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-cotreecliques</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cotreecliques — Maximal-clique recursion in a cotree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0941fdc1df502e5c\" href=\"?note=0941fdc1df502e5c\" title=\"27-df-cotree\">27-df-cotree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9c8c1483ec65329c\" href=\"?note=9c8c1483ec65329c\" title=\"27-df-graphops\">27-df-graphops</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§10.5 Lemma 10.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"468"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"492"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-recursive-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,\\lambda,\\ell,V)\">\\((T,\\lambda,\\ell,V)\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0941fdc1df502e5c\" href=\"?note=0941fdc1df502e5c\" title=\"27-df-cotree\">27-df-cotree</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cotree}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cotree}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq[n]\">\\(V\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_T,I_T,c_T,\\Gamma_T,\\preceq\">\\(L_T,I_T,c_T,\\Gamma_T,\\preceq\\)</span> 取该定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 是任意有限简单图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Vert},\\mathrm{Edges}\">\\(\\mathrm{Vert},\\mathrm{Edges}\\)</span>、诱导子图见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9c8c1483ec65329c\" href=\"?note=9c8c1483ec65329c\" title=\"27-df-graphops\">27-df-graphops</a> 及其上游 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"448689b85eeddd41\" href=\"?note=448689b85eeddd41\" title=\"27-df-graph\">27-df-graph</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 为有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_j\\subseteq\\mathcal P(V)\">\\(\\mathcal A_j\\subseteq\\mathcal P(V)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in J\">\\(j\\in J\\)</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_v,G_v,\\mathcal K,\\bigotimes\">\\(V_v,G_v,\\mathcal K,\\bigotimes\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_v\\coloneqq\\{\\ell(w)\\mid w\\in L_T,\\ v\\preceq w\\},\\qquad G_v\\coloneqq\\Gamma_T[V_v]\\quad(v\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_v\\coloneqq\\{\\ell(w)\\mid w\\in L_T,\\ v\\preceq w\\},\\qquad G_v\\coloneqq\\Gamma_T[V_v]\\quad(v\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K(H)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\left(\\forall a,b\\in C\\;(a\\ne b\\Rightarrow\\{a,b\\}\\in\\mathrm{Edges}(H))\\right)\\land\n\\left(\\forall w\\in\\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\setminus C\\;\\exists a\\in C\\;(\\{a,w\\}\\notin\\mathrm{Edges}(H))\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K(H)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\left(\\forall a,b\\in C\\;(a\\ne b\\Rightarrow\\{a,b\\}\\in\\mathrm{Edges}(H))\\right)\\land\n\\left(\\forall w\\in\\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\setminus C\\;\\exists a\\in C\\;(\\{a,w\\}\\notin\\mathrm{Edges}(H))\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigotimes_{j\\in J}\\mathcal A_j\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\bigcup_{j\\in J}C_j\\ \\middle|\\ (C_j)_{j\\in J}\\in\\prod_{j\\in J}\\mathcal A_j\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigotimes_{j\\in J}\\mathcal A_j\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\bigcup_{j\\in J}C_j\\ \\middle|\\ (C_j)_{j\\in J}\\in\\prod_{j\\in J}\\mathcal A_j\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u\\in L_T\\quad\\mathcal K(G_u)=\\{\\{\\ell(u)\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u\\in L_T\\quad\\mathcal K(G_u)=\\{\\{\\ell(u)\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u\\in I_T\\quad\\left(\\lambda(u)=0\\Rightarrow\\mathcal K(G_u)=\\bigcup_{v\\in c_T(u)}\\mathcal K(G_v)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u\\in I_T\\quad\\left(\\lambda(u)=0\\Rightarrow\\mathcal K(G_u)=\\bigcup_{v\\in c_T(u)}\\mathcal K(G_v)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u\\in I_T\\quad\\left(\\lambda(u)=1\\Rightarrow\\mathcal K(G_u)=\\bigotimes_{v\\in c_T(u)}\\mathcal K(G_v)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u\\in I_T\\quad\\left(\\lambda(u)=1\\Rightarrow\\mathcal K(G_u)=\\bigotimes_{v\\in c_T(u)}\\mathcal K(G_v)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Lemma 10.2，印刷 p.468／PDF p.492。并节点不同孩子间无边，极大团只来自一个孩子；连接节点跨孩子全相邻，极大团必须在每个孩子取一个极大团。孩子载体不交确保所取分量唯一，后续计数不重复。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-cotree","status":"resolved","id":"0941fdc1df502e5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cotree]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-graphops","status":"resolved","id":"9c8c1483ec65329c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-graphops]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cotree","status":"resolved","id":"0941fdc1df502e5c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$(T,\\lambda,\\ell,V)$ 满足 [[27-df-cotree]] 的 $\\mathrm{Cotree}$，$V\\subseteq[n]$；$L_T,I_T,c_T,\\Gamma_T,\\preceq$ 取该定义。$H$ 是任意有限简单图；$\\mathrm{Vert},\\mathrm{Edges}$、诱导子图见 [[27-df-graphops]] 及其上游 [[27-df-graph]]。$J$ 为有限集，$\\mathcal A_j\\subseteq\\mathcal P(V)$（$j\\in J$）；$V_v,G_v,\\mathcal K,\\bigotimes$ 由下式定义。","embed":fal