ex":"\\bigotimes_{j\\in J}\\mathcal A_j\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\bigcup_{j\\in J}C_j\\ \\middle|\\ (C_j)_{j\\in J}\\in\\prod_{j\\in J}\\mathcal A_j\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall u\\in L_T\\quad\\mathcal K(G_u)=\\{\\{\\ell(u)\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall u\\in I_T\\quad\\left(\\lambda(u)=0\\Rightarrow\\mathcal K(G_u)=\\bigcup_{v\\in c_T(u)}\\mathcal K(G_v)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall u\\in I_T\\quad\\left(\\lambda(u)=1\\Rightarrow\\mathcal K(G_u)=\\bigotimes_{v\\in c_T(u)}\\mathcal K(G_v)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2224,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-cotreecliques|thm-cotreecliques — Maximal-clique recursion in a cotree]]"},{"id":"dfd688b37f7bc20d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$(T,\\lambda,\\ell,V)$ 满足 [[27-df-cotree]] 的 $\\mathrm{Cotree}$，子树图族 $(G_w)_{w\\in T}$ 和极大团族 $\\mathcal K$ 见 [[27-thm-cotreecliques]]。$I_T,c_T,\\preceq$ 取该 cotree 定义。$s_w,L_w$ 对每个 $w\\in T$ 由下式定义。"},{"id":"5b42b5bd5b357f2f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$(T,\\lambda,\\ell,V)$ 满足 [[27-df-cotree]] 的 $\\mathrm{Cotree}$，$\\varnothing\\ne V\\subseteq[n]$，$A_\\epsilon:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 与 $\\Gamma_T$ 取该定义。$\\mathcal M,G,\\mathrm{Normal}_n$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]；$\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-readoncefunc]]，极大团族 $\\mathcal K$ 见 [[27-thm-cotreecliques]]。"}],"outgoing":["0941fdc1df502e5c","9c8c1483ec65329c","448689b85eeddd41"]}